{
 "_doc": [
  "Hoenn music on Black 2's instruments (notes/MUSIC.md). b2tools/m4a_to_sseq.py reads this file; b2tools/patches/hoenn_music.py installs the songs and the Hoenn/Unova option.",
  "library: the Black 2 bank whose instruments the converted songs use (BANK_MUS_WB_SOUNDLIST: Black/White's whole instrument set under fixed program numbers; no sequence plays it). Each song gets its own bank and wave archive cut from it.",
  "instruments: what each library program is (Black 2's own Hoenn remixes SEQ_BGM_VS_RS_LEADER / VS_RS_CHAMP, how Black/White's songs use each program, envelopes and spectra: notes/MUSIC.md).",
  "defaults: GBA sample name (pokeruby, without the _NN key suffix) or 'drums' -> program. drum_keys: GBA drum key -> Black 2 kit key where the General MIDI layouts differ. noise: the GBA noise channel as the kit's closed (short) / open (long_gate ticks and longer) hi-hat. roles: square waves and the programmable wave by role (b2tools/music_roles.py) and context (battle: vs_*, encounter_*, victory_*; else field): a program, 'psg' (Black 2's PSG square of the same duty) or [[min_key, program], ...] (first match).",
  "volume: the INFO volume per context (linear in amplitude, measured); songs: per song (pokeruby name): context, volume, level (factor on the GBA VOL bytes), once (no loop: played as a jingle), voices / parts ('t<track>v<voice>') overrides with program, transpose, gain, drum_key, why; track_gain. Balance is automatic (data/hoenn_music_levels.json); gain/track_gain multiply it.",
  "Hoenn/Unova option (b2tools/patches/hoenn_music.py, .c): slots = each song's sequence slot (fixed, b2tools/music_slots.py); zones get their Sapphire map's song in bgm2 (pokeruby map.json music; zone_songs / part_songs override); redirect = Black 2 id -> Hoenn song when the Hoenn option is on (redirect_ruby in Ruby builds); a Black 2 sequence that ends (every SEQ_ME_* jingle, the evolution intro SEQ_BGM_SHINKA: the game waits for them to end) must get a Hoenn song that ends too, or the wait never returns (v16 froze at the starter: SEQ_ME_POKEGET -> the looping mus_caught); hoenn_music.py refuses such a redirect; reverse = Hoenn song -> Black 2 stand-in when it is off (songs scripts name directly); wild = species -> song; classes = per Black 2 trainer class overrides of the computed eye / battle / victory songs; win_by_class = victory ids whose song follows the last trainer's class (Elite Four: victory_league)."
 ],
